  "details": "We live in the era of A.I. and even better, open-sourced large language models capable of handling real time pier to pier translation. A tool like this could be GAME CHANGING if implemented into VRChat, it could revolutionize how we communicate and bridge cultural gaps through more understanding of one another. This technology is already available for every day people (if you download some software and have the know how.) So a feature like this should not be hard for VRChat to implement. I hope that a feature that's able to translate languages via voice to text or some form similar will be considered!",
